silm:instances_papers_01_orientation_chapters_15_witness_traceability_sections_02_witness_chain_protocol_decomposition_step_3__step_joc_§15_1_factorization__source_is_file_on_disk;_target_is_l a owl:NamedIndividual ;
    rdfs:label "Joy of Cats §15.1 says every morphism in a factorization system has a declared source and target. In the witness chain, the source is the file on disk; the target is the local key. The four gates are the factored morphisms: locate goes source->LineRange; extract goes LineRange->VerbatimQuote; key goes VerbatimQuote->LocalKey. The factorization system license guarantees each gate is a named step with declared endpoints." .
